he United Nations, international diplomacy. New York City is known for its fast pace and continuous urban energy.","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7a/View_of_Empire_State_Building_from_Rockefeller_Center_New_York_City_dllu_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-View_of_Empire_State_Building_from_Rockefeller_Center_New_York_City_dllu_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_York_City"},"twins":["Q1781","Q1218","Q34647","Q85","Q84","Q2807","Q956","Q34820","Q1490","Q2844","Q894327","Q585","Q3561","Q3630","Q33935","Q51103","Q8686","Q101625","Q8684","Q1491","Q188673","Q612","Q1489","Q220"]}